  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-final-answer-view",
      "text": "[](https://github.com/jianjianzhu/dsh-final-answer-view/actions/workflows/ci.yml)\n[](LICENSE)\n\nDeepSeek Harness Web 插件：后台继续完整执行任务，界面只保留最终答案。"
    },
    {
      "section": "行为",
      "text": "- 隐藏运行中的思考、上下文注入、读取、Shell 与其他工具轨迹。\n- 一轮完成后仅显示该轮最后一条助手答案。\n- 审批、错误、上下文耗尽等需要用户关注的内容不会隐藏。\n- 设置入口：`设置 → 插件 → 最终结果视图`。\n- 开关保存在浏览器 `localStorage`，默认开启。"
    },
    {
      "section": "开发",
      "text": "```powershell\nnpm run build\nnpm test\nnpm pack --dry-run\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装",
      "text": "```powershell\ndsh plugin --profile web add dsh-final-answer-view\n```\n\n安装后重启 DeepSeek Harness Web。\n\n本地开发版可以直接安装目录：\n\n```powershell\nnode D:\\deepseek-harness\\apps\\cli\\lib\\bin.js plugin --profile web add E:\\.weixincodex\\dsh-final-answer-view\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "插件市场准备",
      "text": "发布 npm 包后，可将 `dsh-final-answer-view` 提交到 Awesome DSH Plugin / dsh-market 的 **UI Enhancements** 分类。\n\n推荐描述：\n\n> Final-answer-only view for DeepSeek Harness Web: hides live reasoning, context injection, tool traces and intermediate assistant steps while preserving approvals, errors and the completed final answer."
    }
  ],
